From: Hermes <agent@local>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 02:27:14 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add temperature+top-k sampling, logit debug dump,
 multi-prompt mode

- --temperature T: 0=greedy (default), >0=scaled sampling
- --top-k K: restrict sampling to top-K tokens (0=no filter)
- Logit debug dump: top-5 logits with stats for first 5 decode steps
- --prompts-file: load N prompts, reset KV cache between each
- KV cache reset via sentinel token -2
